{"3806300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Epoch Spire", "steam_appid": 3806300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You explore the floors of a mysterious spire on an alien planet without a nearby star.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When dying in the spire, the only thing you keep is your knowledge. Try again in a new, randomized floor of the tower!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your laser gun to fight monsters and interact with the environment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806300/extras/0eba1262ce866921c91aa6942070b80e.poster.avif?t=1755511443\" aria-label=\"A gif of walking away and shooting an enemy, that is running towards the player, with a laser gun\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806300/extras/0eba1262ce866921c91aa6942070b80e.webm?t=1755511443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806300/extras/0eba1262ce866921c91aa6942070b80e.mp4?t=1755511443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many things are unknown to the player at the beginning. Uncover secrets and solve puzzles to get rewards which will make you stronger for your current try! Once you know how to solve a puzzle, you will be able to solve it again in future tries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806300/extras/4f73e50cf6abe1aac2659176f3593c22.poster.avif?t=1755511443\" aria-label=\"A gif of finding a chest and solving a puzzle by connecting symbols with a laser gun. The reward is a stat upgrade\" width=608